 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "While we were still helpless and weak",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The right time came for the Savior to speak",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not with words of power or fear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But with a heart laid bare and near",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rarely does one die for the good",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or for the just as it should",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We were ungodly, far away",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he did not turn us away",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God proves his love in this alone",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "While we were sinners on the throne",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of our own brokenness and shame",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Christ died for us, the same",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Justified now by his blood",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saved from wrath through his good",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
